{"asset_key":"timeline/timeline_story_1401010431","episode":"timeline","category":"timeline_story","story_id":"1401010431","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434001:":{"text":"おい、印持ち！さっさと列から出てこい！","source_cn":"有印记的罪人！快滚出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EE64044C2A64315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434002:":{"text":"僕は、自分の分を取りにきたのではなくて……","source_cn":"我不是为自己而来的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17C51449788E69FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434003:":{"text":"ベルヴェはもう限界なんです、どうか……","source_cn":"贝丝薇快不行了……求你们","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76E7B0423D97084F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434004:":{"text":"それが法を犯した代価だ！","source_cn":"这就是触犯律法的代价！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D7E34ED469A5F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434005:":{"text":"どうした？","source_cn":"出什么事了？<key:dialog41>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EA49D203F198EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410435001:0":{"text":"女王陛下に栄光あれ！隊長、ご報告します！列に紛れ込んでいた印持ちの平民を発見しました！","source_cn":"女王荣光永存！报告卫队长！这名带印记的平民妄图混入队伍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD74C86F1868F943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410435002:1":{"text":"ぼ、僕はベルヴェの分を受け取りたくて……彼女はもう、体が……","source_cn":"我不是为了自己，是贝丝薇。贝丝薇太虚弱了。她快要……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x037B6D3F7EBE6744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410435003:1":{"text":"お願いします！どうか、どうかベルヴェを助けてください！","source_cn":"求求你们了，各位卫兵大人们！给贝丝薇一点怜悯吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61771932570AE04D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410435004:0":{"text":"本人が取りに来い！代理で受け取ることは法律で禁止されている！","source_cn":"让她自己来取，律法有言，不得代领！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7A0B81741CE86B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410435005:1":{"text":"で、でも……ベルヴェも、印が……","source_cn":"贝丝薇……也身负印记，她——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A7FD1001E02691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410435006:0":{"text":"はっ！だったらなおさら無理な話だ！司祭様に印を刻まれたとういうことは、そいつも罪人なんだろ！","source_cn":"哼！那还有什么好说的！祭司大人们难道会平白无故地惩罚无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x533BD077FC0B2E33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410435007:0":{"text":"お願いします、どうか、どうか御慈悲を……！","source_cn":"给她一点慈悲吧，卫兵大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2F04F3999034BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410435008:1":{"text":"ありがとう、ヴェクシャさん。どうすればいいか分かったよ……","source_cn":"维克莎，多谢你。我已经知道该怎么做了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AF0F4E8E72F0E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410435009:0":{"text":"分かったならさっさと立ち去れ！","source_cn":"没错，平民。早点死心为好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A6B85A74E0C7EF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410435010:0":{"text":"ああ、そうだ。戻る前にその女の居場所を教えろ。俺たちが処分しに行く。","source_cn":"对了，待会记得上报她的位置，我们会负责清理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF2690421B342FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410435011:0":{"text":"いえ、彼女はまだ大丈夫です。もう戻らないと、ベルヴェが僕を待っているので……","source_cn":"不，贝丝薇还好。她还能坚持……我先走了！她现在很需要我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57829F2BFA423FDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410435012:1":{"text":"なんて……むごい……","source_cn":"你们……太欺负人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE3849AC2284E00E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410435013:0":{"text":"そろそろ交代の時間だ。","source_cn":"你，时候不早了，准备交接吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2B6D02C9B44BB32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410435014:0":{"text":"隊長、あの男を見張らなくて大丈夫ですか？もし……","source_cn":"卫队长，我们真的不用去盯着那小子吗？以防万一……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D97CE37AEF3809F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410435015:0":{"text":"……それは私が手配しておく。お前はもう戻って休め。","source_cn":"……无事，我稍后再安排。你早点回去休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71133FCED0E37672","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410435016:0":{"text":"はっ！女王陛下に栄光あれ！","source_cn":"遵命！女王荣光永存！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0F14F9E84621734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1410435017:0":{"text":"列に並べ！一人ずつ順番に受け取るんだ！","source_cn":"都排好队，一个一个来领取！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x631B897D98B30B62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410435018:0":{"text":"インドラだ！みんな、ちゃんと列に並べ……","source_cn":"是因度厄！大家该排队的好好排队……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D1F94BFC42CBB3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1410435019:1":{"text":"インドラ隊長が来たわ！","source_cn":"因度厄卫队长来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3433592303C7E23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:35:1410436001:":{"text":"あそこに並んでる人……印がついてるような？","source_cn":"那个排队的人……好像也有印记","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA73FF18878086155","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あそこに並んでる人……印がついてるような？","female":"あそこに並んでる人……印がついてるような？","variant_male_record_index":"158497","variant_female_record_index":"158498","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:35:1410436002:":{"text":"全員分あるから、慌てるな！","source_cn":"保持秩序！大家都能分到","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDA573E4A492F2B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:35:1410436003:":{"text":"インドラ、君は一体……？","source_cn":"因度厄，你到底是什么样的人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFCDABE8EB79AF8DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"インドラ、君は一体……？","female":"インドラ、あなたは一体……？","variant_male_record_index":"158499","variant_female_record_index":"158500","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:35:1410436004:":{"text":"……試してみようか。","source_cn":"也许……我该试试","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB3CFF309C562E0E6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"……試してみようか。","female":"……試してみましょう。","variant_male_record_index":"158501","variant_female_record_index":"158502","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:36:1410437001:0":{"text":"あなたは平民たちとともに霊水の行列に並んだ。インドラは処罰の印に気づいていたはずだが、何の問題もなく霊水を受け取ることができた。","source_cn":"你跟随着其他平民排队领取恩典灵露，因度厄似乎对你不加掩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5018ADB15C313E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:37:1410437002:0":{"text":"霊水を調べたところ、ごく少量だが、特殊な魔力を感じる……長期的に摂取することで、厄化を回避できるのは確かなようだ。","source_cn":"你探查这份灵露，发现其中蕴含了特殊的魔力……虽然含量很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A6F31D9BBF18745","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:38:1410437003:0":{"text":"列を観察していると、印を刻まれた平民にも霊水が配られていた。インドラはそれに気づいていながら、あえて見逃しているようだ。","source_cn":"随后你仔细观察着队伍，同样有一些身负惩罚印记的平民获取...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345FFC1EEB0E73FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:40:1410438001:":{"text":"うわっ……！た、大変だ！","source_cn":"不……这个人他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA12721A4CF0E8251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:40:1410438002:":{"text":"助けて！厄化よ！","source_cn":"救命！是孽化者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94C7AE041B1E7709","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:40:1410438003:":{"text":"逃げろ！早く！","source_cn":"所有人撤离！快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F0C058A42DEC2D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:40:1410438004:":{"text":"そんな！あれは、ケイデン！？","source_cn":"不！那是凯登！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5CC4CC4D3892848","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1410439001:0":{"text":"やめてください！ケイデンは、優しい子なんです！","source_cn":"不要伤害凯登！他是个好孩子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x486697EDCDFEF79D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1410439002:0":{"text":"来るな！すでに厄化している。お前たちは安全な場